# Workspace layout

Canonical rules for **all** agents: root `AGENTS.md`.  
`.cursor/rules/` is Cursor-specific detail; the policy is the same.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `syncdatesy-adapter/` | Backend / API adapter, k8s manifests, platform docs |
| `frontend/data-syncher-ui/` | Customer-facing React SPA (Vite) |
| `odata-agent/` | Reference ODATA on-prem proxy agent (client + server) |

## Where to work

- **UI** → `frontend/data-syncher-ui/` (`AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/`)
- **API / migrations / k8s** → `syncdatesy-adapter/` (`AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/`)

```text
// ❌ DON'T — add REST calls only in the adapter when the task is a UI screen
// ✅ DO — UI calls go through data-syncher-ui/src/queryOptions; backend changes in the adapter
```

When a task spans both, implement API contract in the adapter first, then wire hooks in `queryOptions/`.
